现问题\n\n","created_at":"2026-06-22T16:40:21+08:00","updated_at":"2026-06-22T16:40:21+08:00","user":{"id":"672dd45c4ea6673461aa2102","login":"atomgit-bot","object_id":"672dd45c4ea6673461aa2102","name":"atomgit-bot","avatar_url":"https://cdn-img.gitcode.com/fb/bb/88f9bbb284ce2dc057d85551b1bbe66acb35305ce59007d28029609b5e4b9652.png?time=1777513981052","html_url":"https://gitcode.com/atomgit-bot"},"comment_type":"pr_comment"},{"id":176545044,"discussion_id":"1e55f15c4cbecce62b88bf07c43d78e774469142","body":"基于对变更文件 `matmul/mat_mul_v3/op_host/op_api/aclnn_addmm.cpp` 的审查，我已完成分析。以下是我的发现：\n\n---\n\n#### 变更摘要\n\n该 PR 修复了 `addmm` 在 16in32out（mat1/mat2 为 fp16 或 bf16、output 为 fp32）场景下，当输入数值较大时输出 inf 的 bug。核心改动是在 `AddmmMatmulGraph::Impl()` 中，对 bias 执行 Muls（`beta * bias`）之前，先将其 Cast 为 `DT_FLOAT` 类型，避免低精度下的数值溢出。\n\n**主要改动**\n\n- **`AddmmMatmulGraph::Impl()` 增加 bias 的 FP32 Cast**：在 `enable16In32Out` 为 true 时，调用 `l0op::Cast(bias, op::DataType::DT_FLOAT, executor)` 将 bias 转为 FP32，再将转换结果传入 `MulsProcess`，防止 fp16/bf16 下 `beta * bias` 因数值过大溢出为 inf。\n- **`AddmmAlpha0Graph::Impl()` 遗漏相同修复**：`AddmmAlpha0Graph` 在 alpha==0 路径下同样调用 `MulsProcess(bias, beta, false, executor)`，但未对 bias 进行 Cast。当 16in32out 条件满足且 beta 较大时，同样存在溢出风险，该修复未覆盖此代码路径。\n\n---\n\n**已审查文件清单：**\n\n| 文件 | 结果 |\n|------|------|\n| `matmul/mat_mul_v3/op_host/op_api/aclnn_addmm.cpp` | 发现 1 个问题（`AddmmAlpha0Graph` 遗漏 Cast 修复） |\n\n","created_at":"2026-06-22T16:40:30+08:00","updated_at":"2026-06-22T16:40:30+08:00","user":{"id":"672dd45c4ea6673461aa2102","login":"atomgit-bot","object_id":"672dd45c4ea6673461aa2102","name":"atomgit-bot","avatar_url":"https://cdn-img.gitcode.com/fb/bb/88f9bbb284ce2dc057d85551b1bbe66acb35305ce59007d28029609b5e4b9652.png?time=1777513981052","html_url":"https://gitcode.com/atomgit-bot"},"comment_type":"pr_comment"},{"id":176556124,"discussion_id":"462b58d88bee2acc0786f63bd828a709630600df","body":"### Notification  \nThis pull request has been changed(code update) or closed, so removes the following label(s):